      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, quick question for you. We just bought a new CNC milling machine for the shop. It cost us $85,000, and we're estimating it'll have a useful life of 10 years, with a salvage value of $5,000 at the end of that. Can you walk me through how the straight-line depreciation calculation works for this so I can get it into the year-end reports correctly?",
